{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56147","headline":"七真赞 六 · 杜光庭","name":"七真赞 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学道甚亦苦，晨夜建福田。\n种德犹植树，积篑而成山。\n子能耽玄尚，飘尔升青天，修是无爲道，当与善结缘。\n太上至隐书，名曰智慧篇。\n拔苦其大才，超俗以德真。\n灵姿世所奇，晔若渊中莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}